# Azure service tags for update-microsoft-ips.sh, one per line.
# Copy to update-microsoft-ips.conf and keep only what this server needs.
# All tags: https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/virtual-network/service-tags-overview
#
# Each tag generates snippets/allow-microsoft-<tag>-ipv4.conf and -ipv6.conf,
# e.g. LogicApps.WestEurope -> allow-microsoft-logicapps-westeurope-ipv4.conf

LogicApps.WestEurope
PowerPlatformInfra.WestEurope
